Description: Scala execution client for Ethereum Classic and Ethereum
 Fukuii is an execution client written in Scala. It follows Ethereum
 Classic (ETC, Mordor) with proof of work, and Ethereum (mainnet, Sepolia,
 Hoodi, Ephemery) next to a consensus client over the Engine API.
 .
 Features:
  * ETC and ETH networks built in, selected by name (fukuii etc, fukuii sepolia)
  * SNAP and full sync
  * JSON-RPC, WebSocket and Engine API servers
  * Terminal dashboard (--tui)
